  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5844ee2e-0f8b-4536-8bda-a9f182fa8dd7"],
 " of two message functions"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"0cc21d1c-ea3e-424e-9791-c9a350fee572"],

